  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal Aid, Serbia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">R&#xe4;ttshj&#xe4;lp, Serbien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att st&#xf6;dja ett system f&#xf6;r kostnadsfri  r&#xe4;ttshj&#xe4;lp f&#xf6;r medborgare utan egna medel. Projektet skall st&#xf6;dja framtagandet av en r&#xe4;tthj&#xe4;lps strategi. Del ett handlar om att i konsultation med alla relevanta parter ta fram lagf&#xf6;rslag f&#xf6;r att skapa ett h&#xe5;llbart system f&#xf6;r r&#xe4;ttshj&#xe4;lp. Del tv&#xe5; kommer att erbjuda finansiellt st&#xf6;d till org. som tillh&#xe5;ller r&#xe4;ttshj&#xe4;lp.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to support the establishment of an legal aid system for those who can not afford legal services. And to formulate a strategy for the reform of the legal aid system. Part one of the project is to, in consultation with all other stakeholders develop a draft law for a sustainable free legal aid system. Part two offers financiell support to org. which provide free legal aid.</narrative>
  </description>
